%% 청약 의사결정 노트 / 1차 논리 ERD 초안
%% 업무 속성은 proposal.md의 테이블 표를 참조한다.
%% Mermaid에서 점선은 비식별 관계, 실선은 식별 관계를 뜻한다.
erDiagram
    direction TB

    announcement {
        bigint id PK
        bigint last_source_record_id FK
    }
    unit_type {
        bigint id PK
        bigint announcement_id FK
        bigint last_source_record_id FK
    }
    allocation {
        bigint id PK
        bigint unit_type_id FK
        bigint last_source_record_id FK
    }
    competition_snapshot {
        bigint id PK
        bigint unit_type_id FK
        bigint source_record_id FK
    }
    winning_score_snapshot {
        bigint id PK
        bigint unit_type_id FK
        bigint source_record_id FK
    }
    region {
        string region_code PK
        string parent_code FK
        bigint last_source_record_id FK
    }
    address_match {
        bigint id PK
        bigint announcement_id FK
        string region_code FK
    }
    apartment_trade {
        bigint id PK
        string region_code FK
        bigint last_source_record_id FK
    }
    app_user {
        bigint id PK
    }
    watchlist {
        bigint id PK
        bigint app_user_id FK
        bigint announcement_id FK
    }
    user_note {
        bigint id PK
        bigint watchlist_id FK
    }
    comparison_set {
        bigint id PK
        bigint app_user_id FK
        bigint unit_type_id FK
        string region_code FK
    }
    comparison_trade {
        bigint comparison_set_id PK, FK
        bigint apartment_trade_id PK, FK
        bigint source_record_id FK
    }
    ingestion_run {
        bigint id PK
    }
    source_record {
        bigint id PK
        bigint ingestion_run_id FK
    }

    announcement ||..o{ unit_type : has_models
    unit_type ||..o{ allocation : has_supply
    unit_type ||..o{ competition_snapshot : observed_competition
    unit_type ||..o{ winning_score_snapshot : observed_scores
    region |o..o{ region : parent_region
    announcement ||..o{ address_match : matching_attempts
    region |o..o{ address_match : matched_region
    region ||..o{ apartment_trade : recorded_in
    app_user ||..o{ watchlist : owns
    announcement ||..o{ watchlist : watched_by
    watchlist ||..o{ user_note : has_notes
    app_user ||..o{ comparison_set : saves
    unit_type ||..o{ comparison_set : compared_at
    region ||..o{ comparison_set : comparison_region
    comparison_set ||--o{ comparison_trade : includes
    apartment_trade ||--o{ comparison_trade : used_in
    ingestion_run ||..o{ source_record : captures
    source_record ||..o{ announcement : source_of
    source_record ||..o{ unit_type : source_of
    source_record ||..o{ allocation : source_of
    source_record ||..o{ region : source_of
    source_record ||..o{ apartment_trade : source_of
    source_record ||..o{ competition_snapshot : evidence_for
    source_record ||..o{ winning_score_snapshot : evidence_for
    source_record ||..o{ comparison_trade : frozen_evidence
